hived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-26T19:02:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T12:28:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.5 and 4.4. Haven't tested other versions\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 -Godot 4.5 stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I delete an animation point from BlendSpace1D, I immediately get infinite errors of \"ERROR: scene/animation/animation_tree.cpp:91 - Condition \"!process_state->tree->property_parent_map.has(node_state.base_path)\" is true\".\n\nIf I forget about the error, Godot gets slower and slower until it crashes. Eventually I won't be changing my animation points anymore, but right now I am trying out some different animations, and this has been a problem. Restarting Godot does make the errors stop and adding the animation point back also fixes the problem, but I'm hoping there is a better solution than that.\n\nIt also only seems to happen when you have exactly 2 animation points created and you delete one.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n-Create an AnimationTree node\n-Set AnimationPlayer in AnimationTree\n-Create BlendTree for AnimationTree\n-Create BlendSpace1D node\n-Setup 2 animation points\n-Delete 1 point\n-See output has non stopping errors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[infinite-errors-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22566682/infinite-errors-test.zip)\n\n-To reproduce just delete one of 2 points from the BlendSpace1D node","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110941/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110941/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}